Diagnostics recording

Record diagnostics: in the Android drawer (Developer tools), the PC Developer menu, or with Ctrl+F3. It records 15 s to 2 min, or until stopped, and gives a short Markdown report plus the frames as .jsonl, zipped into perf_<game>_<time>.zip. The report is copied to the clipboard.
What the report says:

the device, the GPU and driver, CPU clocks and thermal state, and the settings;
frame-time percentiles;
a CPU/GPU-bound verdict, and how much slower a processor and GPU…
